      "content": "Yeah, I get that it's a big change. But my boss is a bit worried about how the new rule-based system is going to handle the edge cases you're currently flagging. He's asking if the deterministic engine can actually catch the same level of stuff you do, or if we're just trading one kind of risk for another. Do you see any major gaps in a hard-coded approach compared to how you're doing it now?",
